  "question": {
    "text": "A spherical ball of diameter <math><mn>1</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>cm</mi></math> and density <math><mn>5</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3&nbsp;</mn></mrow></msup><mi>kg</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><msup><mrow><mn>m</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math> is dropped gently in a large tank containing viscous liquid of density <math><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3&nbsp;</mn></mrow></msup><mi>kg</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><msup><mrow><mn>m</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math> and coefficient of viscosity <math><mn>0.1</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>Ns</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><msup><mrow><mn>m</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>. The distance that the ball moves in <math><mn>1</mn><mi>&nbsp;s</mi></math> after attaining terminal velocity is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>m</mn><msup><mrow><mn>s</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac><mn>&nbsp;m</mn></math>",
